## Overview

The calendar app has an in-memory auth system (no localStorage, no backend).

## Files

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `client/types/auth.ts` | `UserAccount` interface |
| `client/components/auth/AuthContext.tsx` | `AuthProvider`, `useAuth()` hook |
| `client/components/auth/SignInScreen.tsx` | Full-page account picker |
| `client/components/auth/ProfileMenu.tsx` | Avatar dropdown (360px, anchored top-right) |

